# Enabled Paths Configuration
#
# This file defines which paths should be scanned during ingestion.
# - If this file exists and contains paths, ONLY these paths will be scanned
# - If this file is empty or doesn't exist, all DOCS_PATHS will be scanned
# - After enabled paths are determined, .ingestignore rules are applied
#
# Format:
# - One path per line
# - Lines starting with # are comments
# - Both absolute and relative paths are supported
# - Paths can be files or directories
# - Glob patterns are supported (e.g., /path/to/*.pdf, /path/**/documents)
#
# Examples:
# /mnt/Documents/Documents/Projects
# /mnt/Documents/Documents/Notes/*.md
# /mnt/resources/Libros/Aprendizaje/Programming
# ./data/important_docs

# Add your enabled paths below:

/mnt/Documents/Documents
/mnt/resources/Libros